  "evidence": "The freshness test `assert_orders_fresh` is attached to stg_orders and fails because the `_loaded_at` timestamps in raw.orders range from 1992 to 1998, far older than any typical freshness threshold. The raw data itself is static historical TPCH data and is correct; the test configuration expecting recent data is inappropriate. Adjusting or removing the freshness test (or its threshold) will resolve the failure."
